      'Full access to the entire app',
      'Includes Coaches Only',
      'Direct coaching access with Lee',
      'Full team and position-specific training',
      'Study The Game section',
      'Pro drills and voice-over training',
      'Live seminars and session planning',
      'Session plan videos and PDF plans',
      'Behind-the-scenes coaching access',
    ],
