  ['Is Max only for coaches?', 'No. Max is the full Joner Football App for serious players, parents and coaches. The Coaches Only section is included, it is not the only thing in there.'],
  ['Can parents use the app?', 'Yes. Plenty of parents use it to give their player a clear plan at home instead of guessing. Starter is a simple start, Plus gives real structure.'],
  ['Can teams or clubs join?', 'Yes. Team and Club is request only. We set your group up with player and coach access in one system, then scope the pricing to your size.'],
  ['Do players and coaches get separate logins on a team plan?', 'Yes. Every player and coach gets their own login inside your team or club section.'],
  ['Is the app better for beginners or serious players?', 'Both. Beginners start with Starter and follow simple drills. Serious players move to Plus or Max for structure, advanced training and the 100 Day Program.'],
